      "content": "I am sorry to hear you are struggling with insomnia while on quetiapine; this can happen as your body adjusts or the dosage changes. **Do not** take Ativan or any other medication without checking with your doctor first, as combining sedatives increases the risk of overdose, respiratory depression, and falls, especially if you are thyroid-sickened. Since you mentioned being on medication for mood, please contact your prescribing provider today to discuss your sleep issues; they may need to adjust your quetiapine dose or add a specific sleep aid for you. Try keeping your bedroom cool, dark, and quiet tonight, and avoid screens before bed to help improve your chances of falling back asleep.",
