      "content": "i get that but i can't really get an appointment for like two weeks and i'm literally running on zero sleep here. it's getting bad. i have some ativan left over from a different prescription a while back, it's just a low dose. wouldn't a tiny bit of that be fine just to get me through the next few nights until i can actually talk to my doctor? i just need something to knock me out so i can function.",
